'''Beachy''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing the [[Beachy Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or the [[Beach Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
Along the sharp side of the blade down to the pommel there is sand, with a big starfish on the guard. The other side has water, making it have a beach-like appearance. 

== Trivia ==
* It has a chroma counterpart under the name [[Chroma Beachy]].
* It pairs with the godly gun [[Sands]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Beachy Set|Beach Set]].
